BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rec-occurrence-rec-0ace3af3a610-2026-10-07@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261008T030721Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261007T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261007T120000
SUMMARY:Indoor Tot Time - Wednesdays
LOCATION:09/16/2026 - 04/14/2027 10:00 AM - 12:00 PM Norwood Civic Center - Gymnasium
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking for fun and safe play for your child during the fall/winter months? Would you like to meet local parents with children similar in age to your child? Look no further! This program will allow your children to explore a large open space and interact with other children. Climbing mats\, sports equipment\, and play equipment will all be pulled out for the kids to enjoy. Parents/caregivers must accompany their children at all times during this unstructured program. No fee for children under 1 if accompanied by a sibling. $5.00 per day per family (Drop-In) NO FOOD OR DRINKS IN THE GYM PLEASE! NO TOT TIME DURING VACATION WEEKS OR DAYS WHEN CIVIC CENTER IS CLOSED.\nCost: $75.00 Res\, $75.00 Non-Res\nSource: https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30920
URL:https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30920
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-10-08-rejuvenate-your-r-sum-f27f1ea@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261008T030721Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261008T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261008T100000
SUMMARY:Rejuvenate Your Résumé
LOCATION:MassHire Norwood Events
DESCRIPTION:Date — Thursday\, October 8 Time — 10:00 am Platform — Zoom This résumé workshop will explain current trends in résumé writing. Does your résumé include accomplishments? Are you using PAR statements? Are you aware of Applicant Tracking Softw\nSource: https://masshiremsw.com/event/rejuvenate-oct-08/
URL:https://masshiremsw.com/event/rejuvenate-oct-08/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rec-occurrence-rec-7897cdfc7512-2026-10-08@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261008T030721Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261008T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261008T203000
SUMMARY:Adult Paint Night with Letiana - Fall Fest 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join Letiana from Let’s Paint Club for this fun\, adults only paint night in the alley at Lewis's. Come alone or bring a friend\, have a bite to eat and bring home a masterpiece! Food and drink sold separately. Registration Limited. Open to ages 21+ only.\nCost: $30.00 Res\nSource: https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30886
URL:https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30886
END:VEVENT
