BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-10-10-pumpkin-float-lantern-walk@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261008T030721Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T193000
SUMMARY:5th Annual Pumpkin Float & Lantern Walk
LOCATION:Pond at Endean Park — Endean Park\, Norwood\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Local families and groups are invited to carve a pumpkin to float. Cub Scouts Pack 49 will have a campfire for s’mores\, followed by a Norwood Trails Advisory Committee lantern walk. Food trucks will be on site.\nCost: Free\nSource: https://fliphtml5.com/faafw/Fall_20Winter_202026_20PROOF/
URL:https://fliphtml5.com/faafw/Fall_20Winter_202026_20PROOF/
END:VEVENT
